title: The Economic Crisis
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: crisis_urgency >= 1 and crisis_program_timer = 0 and economic_plan = 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
frequency: 200
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; crisis_program_timer = 5
card-image: img/bankrun.jpg
tags: party_affairs, govt_affairs

= Addressing the Economic Crisis

An economic crisis, worse than any the world has seen, now grips Germany. Millions have lost their jobs and wages across the board are decreasing every day. What should we do?

- @aid: Sponsor mutual aid.
- @preparation: Communism in the Soviet Union was only able to arise out of crisis, perhaps it is our time?
- @support_left: Support nationalizations to escape the crisis.
- @united_front_building: Build the united front.
- @defer: Defer making a decision until we have more information.

@aid
subtitle: During these times, we must show workers that we are on their side.
on-arrival: unemployed_kpd += 2; rural_kpd += 2 socialism += 3

Icreasing funding for the Workers International Relief and other mutual aid groups give much needed relief from the brutal austerity of the current government.

Our policy course is currently that nothing can be done to alleviate the depression.


@preparation
subtitle: We must prepare for the revolution.
on-arrival: rfb_strength += 30; rfb_militancy += 0.05
go-to: revolution if unemployed >=20 and workers_kpd >=40 and unemployed_kpd >=40;

We organize the Rotfrontkämpferbund and factory cells in secret as to avoid bourgeois reprisal. Still, our preperations mean nothing without the support of the workers.

@revolution

We have spent a great deal of time and resources into our fighting capabilities and influence over workers. The crisis continues and civil unrest grows ever greater. Is it time?

-@yes_revolution: Strike while the iron is hot!
-@no_revolution: Despite everything, we aren't quite ready.

@yes_revolution 

We launch the revolution! May the workers be on our side.(NOT DONE)

@no_revolution

While disappointing, nobody wants a premature revolution. Memories of the failed Sparticist Uprising and March Action remain and nobody wants a third failiure.

@plan_adopted
on-arrival: wtb_adopted = 1; labor_dissent -= 15; reformist_dissent -= 10; labor_strength += 10; center_strength -= 10; center_dissent += 20; left_dissent += 5; economic_plan = 1

With our hard work, we have finally convinced the majority of the party to adopt the WTB plan! [? if spd_in_government == 1 : We can begin implementing the plan as soon as possible, as long as we have the Economic or Finance ministries. ?][? if spd_in_government = 0 : We should emphasize the plan in our electoral propaganda. ?]

@support_left
subtitle: Call for mass nationalizations and the transformation of the economy.
unavailable-subtitle: The time for working within Bourgeois framework.
choose-if: year >=1932
on-arrival: nationalization_support += 2
go-to: adopt_left

@adopt_left
on-arrival: nationalization_adopted = 1; economic_plan = 3; spd_relation -= 5

This is the consensus choice, even if many beleive it to be impossible under a bourgeois democracy! [? if kpd_in_government == 1 and spd_relation >= 60 and economic_minister_party == spd or finance_minister_party == spd: Because of our friendly relations and control of the relevant ministries, we can persuade the SPD to enact the plan. Bourgeois opposition is likely to be fierce. ?]

@united_front_building
subtitle: Build support for the united front. 
on-arrival: marxist_leninist_dissent += 10 if united_front_maintained == 0; left_opposition_dissent +=10
go-to: comintern_support if united_front_maintained ==1; comintern_opposition if united_front_maintained == 0

@comintern_support: The Comintern approves!
on-arrival: spd_relation +=5; workers_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 2; unemployed_kpd +=2*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd +=2

The Comintern, having maintained the united front in the last world congress supports our action. Conversely, the German bourgeois and far right are terrified.

comintern_opposition: We have come under fierce criticism and risk expulsion.
unavailable-subtitle: Thalmann and Comintern have dissuaded us from this
choose-if: conciliator_strength >= marxist_leninist_strength or nsdap_r <= 20
on-arrival: 

The Comintern's Third Period thesis does not allow for this type of action, but times are quickly changing. [? if spd_relation >=75: The SPD's shift to its left wing has assuage some of the Comintern's doubt. ?]

@defer

We hold off on making decisive policy, awaiting more information. We must not spoil this chance by overplaying our hand. 
